    """``/FAIL/LAD_TRANSVERSE_COMPRESSION/mat_ID`` or ``/FAIL/LADEVEZE_TRANSVERSE_COMPRESSION`` (M309): Ladevèze transverse compressive matrix microcracking and friction-induced crushing damage failure model."""
